      "parameters": {
        "width": 1160,
        "height": 160,
        "content": "## Load context\nReads business.json, knowledge-base.md, system-prompt.md, and config.json from the read-only /files mounts, then merges them into one item: { business, config, knowledge_base, system_prompt }. A missing file fails its read with \"No file(s) found\" (Read/Write Files typeVersion 1.1, checked against n8n `2.45.7` on 2026-11-11), and the caller's run fails with it. Each read also sets Always Output Data and Execute Once, so a read that ever returned no item would still reach its parse step and fail there, instead of the branch silently returning nothing."
      }
    }
